Package: com.changeinfoios.zalo
Name: ChangeInfoIosZalo
Version: 2.6.4
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Ultra-thin device-info spoof sidecar for Zalo. Only 12 cached ObjC pure-read hooks (UIDevice / ASIdentifierManager / UIScreen / NSLocale / NSTimeZone / CTCarrier). No C-level hooks, no keychain dump, no container wipe, no Darwin notify — designed for zero perceptible lag inside Zalo's chat scroll. Use INSTEAD of main ChangeInfoIos tweak for Zalo bundles.
Maintainer: ChangeInfoIos
Author: ChangeInfoIos
Section: Tweaks
Depends: ellekit | mobilesubstrate, firmware (>= 15.0)
